-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a9ed3d666bd4979\" href=\"?note=2a9ed3d666bd4979\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeFrontCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeFrontCover}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}tree\\text{-}front\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeFrontCover}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S(F,T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}tree\\text{-}front\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeFrontCover}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S(F,T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream front predicate uses the actual tree order; set inclusion is not the tree order for an arbitrary tree.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a9ed3d666bd4979","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a9ed3d666bd4979","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\subseteq T$ (front candidate